{"seq":4,"slug":"dependency-graph-analysis","title":"依赖图分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/testing-and-quality/dependency-graph-analysis","wordCount":825,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"依赖图分析\">依赖图分析</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>依赖图分析</strong>是 Monorepo 架构健康的自动化守护者，围绕三类约束与一组量化指标展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>循环依赖</td>\n<td><code>A → B → C → A</code> 形成的环</td>\n<td>零容忍，必须消除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包边界约束</td>\n<td>哪些包可以依赖哪些包（tag 规则）</td>\n<td>自动化强制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层级约束</td>\n<td>依赖只从上层流向下层</td>\n<td>防止架构腐化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>健康指标</td>\n<td>循环数、依赖深度、扇出度等</td>\n<td>持续监测，阈值告警</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键在于<strong>把架构约束从约定变成可自动检查的规则</strong>：循环依赖让构建顺序不确定、类型推导失败，因此必须零容忍；包边界与层级约束若不自动化检查，会随规模增长被悄然破坏。参考健康阈值为——循环依赖数 0、最大依赖深度 ≤ 5、平均扇出 ≤ 5，并应将检查集成到 CI，确保每次 PR 不引入新的架构违规。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要依赖图分析\">为什么需要依赖图分析</h2><p>随着 Monorepo 中包数量的增长，包之间的依赖关系会越来越复杂。没有主动的<strong>依赖图分析</strong>（Dependency Graph Analysis），架构会在不经意间走向混乱：循环依赖悄然产生、底层包开始依赖上层应用、本应独立的模块变得紧密耦合。依赖图分析是 Monorepo 架构健康的自动化守护者。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 健康的依赖图&#10;        direction TB&#10;        H_APP[apps/web] --&gt; H_UI[packages/ui]&#10;        H_APP --&gt; H_UTILS[packages/utils]&#10;        H_UI --&gt; H_TYPES[packages/types]&#10;        H_UTILS --&gt; H_TYPES&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 腐化的依赖图&#10;        direction TB&#10;        B_APP[apps/web] --&gt; B_UI[packages/ui]&#10;        B_UI --&gt; B_UTILS[packages/utils]&#10;        B_UTILS --&gt; B_UI&#10;        B_APP --&gt; B_TYPES[packages/types]&#10;        B_TYPES --&gt; B_APP&#10;    end&#10;\">graph TB\n    subgraph 健康的依赖图\n        direction TB\n        H_APP[apps/web] --&gt; H_UI[packages/ui]\n        H_APP --&gt; H_UTILS[packages/utils]\n        H_UI --&gt; H_TYPES[packages/types]\n        H_UTILS --&gt; H_TYPES\n    end\n    subgraph 腐化的依赖图\n        direction TB\n        B_APP[apps/web] --&gt; B_UI[packages/ui]\n        B_UI --&gt; B_UTILS[packages/utils]\n        B_UTILS --&gt; B_UI\n        B_APP --&gt; B_TYPES[packages/types]\n        B_TYPES --&gt; B_APP\n    end\n</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"循环依赖检测\">循环依赖检测</h2><p><strong>循环依赖</strong>（Circular Dependencies）是 Monorepo 中最危险的架构问题。当 <code>A → B → C → A</code> 形成环时，构建顺序变得不确定，类型推导可能失败，运行时行为可能不可预测。</p>\n<h3 id=\"使用-madge-检测循环依赖\">使用 madge 检测循环依赖</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 安装 madge&#10;// pnpm add -D madge -w&#10;&#10;// 检测包内的循环依赖&#10;// npx madge --circular packages/utils/src&#10;&#10;// 检测 TypeScript 文件的循环依赖&#10;// npx madge --circular --extensions ts,tsx packages/ui/src&#10;&#10;// 生成依赖图（SVG）&#10;// npx madge --image graph.svg packages/ui/src\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 安装 madge</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// pnpm add -D madge -w</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 检测包内的循环依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npx madge --circular packages/utils/src</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 检测 TypeScript 文件的循环依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npx madge --circular --extensions ts,tsx packages/ui/src</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 生成依赖图（SVG）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npx madge --image graph.svg packages/ui/src</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"使用-nx-的依赖图可视化\">使用 Nx 的依赖图可视化</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 启动 Nx 依赖图 Web UI&#10;// npx nx graph&#10;&#10;// 查看受影响的项目&#10;// npx nx affected --graph&#10;&#10;// 输出 JSON 格式的依赖图&#10;// npx nx graph --file=output.json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 启动 Nx 依赖图 Web UI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npx nx graph</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 查看受影响的项目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npx nx affected --graph</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 输出 JSON 格式的依赖图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npx nx graph --file=output.json</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;graph&quot;: &quot;nx graph&quot;,&#10;    &quot;check:circular&quot;: &quot;madge --circular --extensions ts,tsx packages/*/src apps/*/src&quot;,&#10;    &quot;check:deps&quot;: &quot;turbo run build --dry-run --graph&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"graph\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"nx graph\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"check:circular\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"madge --circular --extensions ts,tsx packages/*/src apps/*/src\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"check:deps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"turbo run build --dry-run --graph\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"包边界约束\">包边界约束</h2><p><strong>包边界</strong>（Package Boundaries）定义了哪些包可以依赖哪些包。例如：<code>packages/</code> 下的库不能依赖 <code>apps/</code> 下的应用，<code>utils</code> 不能依赖 <code>ui</code>。这些规则需要自动化检查来强制执行。</p>\n<h3 id=\"使用-nx-的-module-boundary-rules\">使用 Nx 的 Module Boundary Rules</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;plugins&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;plugin&quot;: &quot;@nx/eslint-plugin&quot;,&#10;      &quot;options&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;targetDefaults&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;lint&quot;: {&#10;            &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;default&quot;]&#10;          }&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"plugins\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"plugin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@nx/eslint-plugin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"options\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"targetDefaults\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"lint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// project.json - 定义包的 tag&#10;{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;ui&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tags&quot;: [&quot;scope:shared&quot;, &quot;type:lib&quot;]&#10;}&#10;&#10;{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;web&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tags&quot;: [&quot;scope:app&quot;, &quot;type:app&quot;]&#10;}&#10;&#10;{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;utils&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tags&quot;: [&quot;scope:shared&quot;, &quot;type:util&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// project.json - 定义包的 tag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"tags\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"scope:shared\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type:lib\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"web\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"tags\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"scope:app\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type:app\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"tags\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"scope:shared\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type:util\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// eslint.config.ts - 使用 @nx/enforce-module-boundaries&#10;import nxPlugin from &#39;@nx/eslint-plugin&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default [&#10;  {&#10;    plugins: { &#39;@nx&#39;: nxPlugin },&#10;    rules: {&#10;      &#39;@nx/enforce-module-boundaries&#39;: [&#10;        &#39;error&#39;,&#10;        {&#10;          depConstraints: [&#10;            {&#10;              sourceTag: &#39;type:app&#39;,&#10;              onlyDependOnLibsWithTags: [&#39;type:lib&#39;, &#39;type:util&#39;],&#10;      