     FOUNDATION_LAYER -.-&gt;|❌ 禁止依赖| APP_LAYER\n        SHARED_LAYER -.-&gt;|❌ 禁止依赖| FEATURE_LAYER\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"依赖图健康指标\">依赖图健康指标</h2><p>定义量化指标来持续监测依赖图的健康状态：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>健康阈值</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>循环依赖数</td>\n<td>madge 检测</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>任何循环都应消除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大依赖深度</td>\n<td>DAG 最长路径</td>\n<td>≤ 5</td>\n<td>过深说明抽象过度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均扇出</td>\n<td>包的平均依赖数</td>\n<td>≤ 5</td>\n<td>过高说明耦合过重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>孤立包数</td>\n<td>无被依赖的非 app 包</td>\n<td>尽量少</td>\n<td>可能是废弃包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层级违反数</td>\n<td>自定义检查</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>架构约束被遵守</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;check:health&quot;: &quot;node scripts/check-deps-health.mjs&quot;,&#10;    &quot;check:circular&quot;: &quot;madge --circular --extensions ts,tsx packages/ apps/&quot;,&#10;    &quot;check:layers&quot;: &quot;node scripts/check-layer-constraints.mjs&quot;,&#10;    &quot;check:all&quot;: &quot;pnpm check:circular &amp;&amp; pnpm check:layers &amp;&amp; pnpm check:health&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"check:health\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node scripts/check-deps-health.mjs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"check:circular\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"madge --circular --extensions ts,tsx packages/ apps/\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"check:layers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node scripts/check-layer-constraints.mjs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"check:all\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm check:circular &#x26;&#x26; pnpm check:layers &#x26;&#x26; pnpm check:health\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 将依赖图健康检查加入 CI 流水线，确保每次 PR 都不会引入新的架构违规。预防远比修复容易。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((依赖图分析))&#10;    循环检测&#10;      madge&#10;      Nx graph&#10;      零容忍&#10;    包边界&#10;      tag 标签&#10;      enforce-module-boundaries&#10;      ESLint 规则&#10;    层级约束&#10;      app → feature → shared&#10;      自动化检查&#10;      CI 集成&#10;    健康指标&#10;      循环数&#10;      依赖深度&#10;      扇出度\">mindmap\n  root((依赖图分析))\n    循环检测\n      madge\n      Nx graph\n      零容忍\n    包边界\n      tag 标签\n      enforce-module-boundaries\n      ESLint 规则\n    层级约束\n      app → feature → shared\n      自动化检查\n      CI 集成\n    健康指标\n      循环数\n      依赖深度\n      扇出度</pre><ul>\n<li>依赖图分析是 Monorepo 架构健康的自动化守护者，应集成到 CI 中持续运行</li>\n<li>循环依赖应零容忍，使用 madge 或 Nx graph 定期检测</li>\n<li>包边界约束通过 Nx 的 <code>enforce-module-boundaries</code> 规则或自定义脚本强制执行</li>\n<li>层级约束确保依赖只从上层流向下层，防止架构腐化</li>\n<li>量化健康指标（循环数、依赖深度、扇出度）持续监测依赖图的健康状态</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"依赖图分析","id":"依赖图分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要依赖图分析","id":"为什么需要依赖图分析"},{"level":2,"text":"循环依赖检测","id":"循环依赖检测"},{"level":3,"text":"使用 madge 检测循环依赖","id":"使用-madge-检测循环依赖"},{"level":3,"text":"使用 Nx 的依赖图可视化","id":"使用-nx-的依赖图可视化"},{"level":2,"text":"包边界约束","id":"包边界约束"},{"level":3,"text":"使用 Nx 的 Module Boundary Rules","id":"使用-nx-的-module-boundary-rules"},{"level":2,"text":"层级约束","id":"层级约束"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖图健康指标","id":"依赖图健康指标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CI 流水线设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/testing-and-quality/ci-pipeline-design"},"next":{"title":"多仓迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/migration-and-scale/polyrepo-to-monorepo"}}